================================================================================
What this project contains, and what it does not
================================================================================

This repository contains only original source code: a Python MCP server, a small
Java helper (sources in java/src, built artifact at java/shamela-mcp-helper.jar),
scripts, tests, and documentation.

It contains NO part of Al-Maktaba Al-Shamela: no book texts, no database files,
no Lucene indexes, and none of the jars or the Java runtime that Shamela ships.
It reads an installation already present on the user's own machine, read-only.

================================================================================
Third-party software used at runtime (not redistributed here)
================================================================================

Al-Maktaba Al-Shamela (المكتبة الشاملة)
    https://shamela.ws
    The desktop application, its databases, its search indexes, and the books it
    distributes are the property of their respective owners. This project reads a
    local installation and executes the Java runtime and Apache Lucene jars that
    Shamela itself installs. Nothing of Shamela's is copied into this repository
    or into any package built from it.

Apache Lucene 10.4.0
    Apache License 2.0 — https://lucene.apache.org
    Loaded at runtime from the user's Shamela installation (app/lucene/*).
    lucene-core is additionally downloaded from Maven Central at build time to
    compile the helper against; it is not bundled or redistributed.

AlKhalil Arabic Morphology Analyzer
    Used indirectly: Shamela built the root-stemmed index field and the morphology
    cache this project reads. No AlKhalil code or data is included here.

